OL,3,GNEWSAFurther BBC cuts could undermine
OL,4,Afunding model, union leader warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FFurther cuts to BBC Scotland could
OL,7,F"fundamentally undermine" the
OL,8,Forganisation's funding model, a trade
OL,9,Funion leader has warned.
OL,11,FIt comes after the corporation
OL,12,Fannounced it would axe its Scotland
OL,13,Flinear TV station and about 70 jobs
OL,14,Fnorth of the border as part of
OL,15,Fcost-saving measures.
OL,17,FNational Union of Journalists (NUJ)
OL,18,Forganiser Nick McGowan-Lowe told MSPs
OL,19,Fthat if additional cuts were made,
OL,20,Fpeople in Scotland would question why
OL,21,Fthey pay the licence fee.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
